WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.501
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.336
Before we begin, I just want to
give a shout-out to our show's

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:07.173
number-one fan, the President
of the United States.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:13.079
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.180
As you --

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.249
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.785
As you may have heard
last night, the President

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:21.954
of the United States
went after me on Twitter.

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:24.657
So Melania, if you're watching,
I don't think your anti-bullying

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.158
campaign is working.

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:28.561
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:32.098
It's not working.

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.834
When I saw that Trump insulted
me on Twitter, I was going to

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.269
tweet back immediately,
but I thought I had

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.137
more important things to do.

00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:40.640
Then I thought, wait, shouldn't
<i> he</i> have more important things

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.908
to do?

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.243
He's the President of the --
What are you doing?

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:46.078
You're the President!

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:47.780
Why's he tweeting at me?

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.682
But this is real -- it's a real
tweet from the President.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.518
He wrote, "@Jimmyfallon
is now whimpering to all

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:54.187
that he did the
famous hair show with me,

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.489
where he seriously
messed up my hair."

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:59.158
And that "He would have done it
differently because it is said

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.827
to have humanized me.
He is taking heat.

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:02.962
He called and said,
'monster ratings.'

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:04.264
Be a man, Jimmy!"

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:05.898
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:07.366
It's real.

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.268
It's crazy, the President went
after me on Twitter.

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:11.036
It's pretty much the only thing
I have in common with

00:01:11.036 --> 00:01:13.105
NFL players.
I mean, it's the only thing.

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:14.807
I have nothing else.

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:17.410
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.411
Well, in response,
I made a donation

00:01:19.411 --> 00:01:22.114
in Trump's name to the Refugee
and Immigrants Center

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:24.383
for Education
and Legal Services.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:27.887
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:30.156
The Refugee and Immigrant Center

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.992
for Education and
Legal Services, or "RAICES."

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:33.993
When Trump heard that
he was like, [ As Trump ]

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.094
"I love 'raices,'

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:36.095
they're my favorite
peanut butter cup.

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:37.229
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:39.432
There's no wrong way
to eat a 'raices.'"

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:44.070
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.838
[ Normal voice ] Let's get
to some real news here.

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:49.575
A new poll found that 58% of
Americans think President Trump

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:53.913
is intelligent.
In response, Trump was like,

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.848
[ As Trump ] "Okay,
what do the other 58% say?"

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:59.519
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:00.920
[ Normal voice ] Today at
the White House, Trump met

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.522
with the King and Queen of
Jordan, which got awkward when

00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:05.758
Trump thanked the King of Jordan
for giving us Michael.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:08.761
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.062
This is a big story --
this weekend,

00:02:10.062 --> 00:02:12.432
White House Press Secretary
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:15.100
was kicked out of
a restaurant in Virginia.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.604
Turns out her server asked her
what she wanted as an appetizer

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.405
and out of habit,
she refused to answer.

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:20.405
And --

00:02:20.405 --> 00:02:23.009
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.144
Actually, the President
responded on Twitter

00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:27.646
to the restaurant, which is
called The Red Hen.

00:02:27.646 --> 00:02:29.615
Again, this is real.
Trump tweeted,

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:31.884
"The Red Hen Restaurant
should focus more on cleaning

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:34.887
its filthy canopies, doors,
and windows (badly needs

00:02:34.887 --> 00:02:37.490
a paint job) rather than
refusing to serve a fine person

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.592
like Sarah Huckabee Sanders.
I always had a rule,

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:41.294
if a restaurant is dirty
on the outside,

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:43.395
it is dirty on the inside!"

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:45.331
So if you ever read
a Yelp review and thought,

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.665
"Who's got the time
to write this?"

00:02:46.665 --> 00:02:49.302
the answer is, the President
of the United States.

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:50.636
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:55.575
He's writing Yelp reviews!

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:59.212
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:00.813
This is cool here.
Meghan Markle has become

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.015
the first member of
the royal family to be nominated

00:03:03.015 --> 00:03:05.918
for a "Teen Choice" award.

00:03:05.918 --> 00:03:07.687
And not to be outdone,
the Queen has announced

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:10.522
she's doing an album with Migos.
It'll be cool.

00:03:10.522 --> 00:03:11.591
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:14.060
-Yeah, that's good.
-Should be fun.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.429
Finally, I want to say congrats
to "fixer upper" hosts

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:19.498
Chip and Joanna Gaines, who just
welcomed a new baby boy.

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:20.900
Isn't that great?

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.401
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:22.401 --> 00:03:25.672
They are thrilled and said that
after a few weeks of raising

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:27.673
him, they'll flip him
for an even better baby.

00:03:27.673 --> 00:03:29.008
We have a great show tonight!

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.543
Give it up for
The Roots, everybody!

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:32.245
♪♪

